  "title": "Basil Chicken and Pasta",
  "description": "Tender morsels of chicken are sauteed in butter and seasoned with garlic and basil before being simmered with heavy cream and Parmesan cheese to make a delectably rich sauce for the pasta of your choice.",
  "authors": [
